+and both sign-character vectors are all zero.  Writing these exponents as
+`d1_r,d2_r`, the exact identity is
+
+\[
+\boxed{
+F_{r,g\lambda}(T_gx)
+=\omega^{a d_{1r}+b d_{2r}}F_{r,\lambda}(x)
+}\tag{4.3}
