+
+## 6. Orbit count and D27+ gate
+
+The action on labels has trivial stabilizer, hence
+
+\[
+\#(\Lambda/G)=1,\qquad |G|=36.\tag{6.1}
+\]
+
+For every faithful emitted depth system, any isomorphism-invariant solver
