+# PCC and radical-fiber equivariance
+
+**Date:** 2026-08-20  
+**Scope:** primary audit of the banked TD-bound machinery and exact
+radical-fiber computation in the residue-A, fixed-`r3`, `B`-frozen, no-log,
+`PIN42`, `W1*W2 != 0` chart.  
